" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>, its <span style=\"display: inline-block; height: 20px; width: 20px; margin-left: -3px; margin-top: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png/23px-Movement_Speed_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png/23px-Movement_Speed_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Resources#Movement_speed\" title=\"Resources\">Movement Speed</a> increases by 9 m (30 ft),<sup><i>[<a href=\"/wiki/Haste_Spores_(Condition)#Bugs\" title=\"Haste Spores (Condition)\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup> and it can take one additional <span style=\"display: inline-block; height: 20px; width: 20px; margin-left: -3px; margin-top: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> per turn.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> </span>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Crafted via <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemy</a> by combining<span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sublimate_of_Haste_Spores\" title=\"Sublimate of Haste Spores\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Sublimate_of_Haste_Spores_Item_Icon.png/20px-Sublimate_of_Haste_Spores_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Sublimate_of_Haste_Spores_Item_Icon.png/30px-Sublimate_of_Haste_Spores_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Sublimate_of_Haste_Spores_Item_Icon.png/40px-Sublimate_of_Haste_Spores_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Sublimate_of_Haste_Spores_Item_Icon.png/20px-Sublimate_of_Haste_Spores_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Sublimate_of_Haste_Spores_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sublimate_of_Haste_Spores\" title=\"Sublimate of Haste Spores\">Sublimate of Haste Spores</a> (procured from <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hastening_Spores\" title=\"Hastening Spores\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Hastening_Spores_Item_Icon.png/20px-Hastening_Spores_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Hastening_Spores_Item_Icon.png/30px-Hastening_Spores_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Hastening_Spores_Item_Icon.png/40px-Hastening_Spores_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Hastening_Spores_Item_Icon.png/20px-Hastening_Spores_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a8/Hastening_Spores_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hastening_Spores\" title=\"Hastening Spores\">Hastening Spores</a>) and any <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">Essence</a></li>\n<li>Given by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spaw\" title=\"Spaw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Portrait_Spaw.png/25px-Portrait_Spaw.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Portrait_Spaw.png/38px-Portrait_Spaw.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Portrait_Spaw.png/50px-Portrait_Spaw.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spaw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Portrait_Spaw.png/25px-Portrait_Spaw.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/65/Portrait_Spaw.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spaw\" title=\"Spaw\">Spaw</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Although the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Haste_Spores_(cloud)\" title=\"Haste Spores (cloud)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Haste_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp/25px-Haste_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ad/Haste_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp/38px-Haste_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ad/Haste_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp/50px-Haste_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Haste Spores\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Haste_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp/25px-Haste_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ad/Haste_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Haste_Spores_(cloud)\" title=\"Haste Spores (cloud)\">Haste Spores</a> area created by throwing this grenade lasts three turns, the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Haste_Spores_(Condition)\" title=\"Haste Spores (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Haste Spores\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Haste_Spores_(Condition)\" title=\"Haste Spores (Condition)\">Haste Spores</a> condition created by walking through it lasts just 1 turn<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"only 1 turn in honour mod...\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup> unless renewed by leaving and re-entering the area again before it dissipates.\n<ul><li>Although functionally similar to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Haste\" title=\"Haste\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/20px-Haste_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/30px-Haste_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/40px-Haste_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Haste\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/20px-Haste_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Haste\" title=\"Haste\">Haste</a>, when the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Haste_Spores_(Condition)\" title=\"Haste Spores (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Haste Spores\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Haste_Spores_(Condition)\" title=\"Haste Spores (Condition)\">Haste Spores</a> condition from this item expires, users are not left <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lethargic_(Condition)\" title=\"Lethargic (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lethargic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lethargic_(Condition)\" title=\"Lethargic (Condition)\">Lethargic</a>.</li>\n<li>The price of a Haste Spore Grenade is 5 higher than that a Potion of Speed.</li></ul></li>\n<li>To obtain this item from Spaw, the party must agree to help kill the duergar invaders the first time they speak with him by selecting, <i>\"Sure, I can handle those duergar nearby.\"</i>, as the flag <code>UND_MyconidCircle_SovereignOfferedSpores</code> is only set for this line of dialogue. Asking Spaw about animating corpses (<i>\"What in the hells did you do to that corpse?\"</i>), going back to the previous dialogue tree (<i>\"Let's talk about something else.\"</i>), and then agreeing to help (<i>\"I'll cleanse the rot. Those duergar near the lake will die.\"</i>) does not award the grenades since it does not set the flag.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202640\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.128 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.136 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5042/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78469/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 19587/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.035/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1596486/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  110.971      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n100.00%  110.971      1 -total\n 39.47%   43.796     17 Template:Icon_text\n 36.55%   40.565     54 Template:Trim\n 20.37%   22.604     10 Template:Icon_link\n 18.51%   20.538      1 Template:Area_full\n 15.32%   17